                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>
بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيْمِ حَمِ تَنْزِيْلُ الكِتَابِ مِنَ اللهِ العَزِيْزِ الحَكِيْمِ
</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#14r">-14r</locus>
قَالُوْا كَذَلِكَ قَالَ رَبُّكِ اِنّهُ هُوَ الحَكِيْمُ العَليْمُ
</explicit>
                     <note>46:1-51:30. Title of suras rubricated. Twelve lines a page. At the end of the ǧuz’, taṣdīq shaped in a triangular form marked by a red line, followed by a taṣliya. Words left uncompleted on a line, and written in full on the following line. Ihmāl marks (medium kāf-s). Diacritics and vowels with a thinner qalam. Catchwords from a different hand. Deletions. In the margins, mark of ǧuz’ (1v) and mark of ḥizb (8v) both in red color, corrections.</note>
                     <note/>
